  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You break out of your defining style, traversing new ground and landing your creations somewhere new. Select an artifex motif that has a different favored tradition from the motif you selected at 1st level. You can select two spells from that motif’s additional spells; one up to 3rd rank, another up to 6th rank and add it to your portfolio. This spell is always prepared in your collection, and does not count towards your collection’s maximum. When you reach 18th level, you can select another spell from the list up to 9th rank.</p>"
